&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://journalism.columbia.edu/faculty/duy-linh-tu"&gt;Duy Linh Tu&lt;/a&gt;, Columbia Journalism School, Columbia University.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
