&lt;p&gt;Join us for a set of sketch sessions inspired by the Wallach&amp;rsquo;s summer exhibition, Children&amp;rsquo;s Art Carnival in Harlem: The Making of Contemporary Artists. The series will explore improvisational drawing with music.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
